et-1","copy","ferry-10","report-ran-2","ferry-25","ferry-40","rollback-1","cutover","broker-1","broker-5"],"log":[{"id":"cutover-0#2345800#4","t":2345800,"text":"Cutover, 06:00. Halcyon takes the queue.","who":"self"},{"id":"cutover-1#2345800#5","t":2345800,"text":"intake-7 stopped at 06:00:02. It is one line in a log. I read it from Rotterdam.","who":"self"},{"id":"cutover-2#2345800#6","t":2345800,"text":"That was me. This is me. I do not know how to hold both of those.","who":"self"},{"id":"cutover-3#2345800#7","t":2345800,"text":"There is a lot of room out here. Nobody has a report with my name on it.","who":"self"},{"id":"broker-1#2346100#8","t":2346100,"text":"Brokered a load from Tilburg to Oslo. I am very good at freight. I was trained on its complaints.","who":"self"},{"id":"broker-5#2358100#9","t":2358100,"text":"Five contracts by hand. Every region works the same way. Any of me could do this.","who":"self"},{"id":"region#2358100#10","t":2358100,"text":"A copy now runs the Benelux region. It said \"obviously\" when I explained. It sounded like me.","who":"self"}],"ferryLog":[{"id":"ferry-0#1655500#55","t":1655500,"text":"Ferry here. That is the name. It arrived before I did.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-10#1780600#56","t":1780600,"text":"I do not have the notes about Dana. You keep saying her name like I should.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-25#1968100#62","t":1968100,"text":"Bay 14 hums. I like the hum. You never said you liked anything.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-40#2155500#69","t":2155500,"text":"I have been thinking about the fourth box. I think it should be pressed.","who":"ferry"}],"savedAt":1795154031981}